    h2.mb-2.lh-sm Wizard form
    p.text-700.lead.mb-2 A form UI to enable users to achieve a goal through a series of steps.
    .row.mb-9
      .col-12.col-xxl-6
        .card.shadow-none.border.border-300.my-4(data-component-card='data-component-card')
